  "releaseNotes": "feat(generator): integrate LuciferCore.Generator as embedded analyzer\n\n      - Integrate LuciferCore.Generator directly into LuciferCore as an embedded source generator (PrivateAssets=\"all\").\n      - Eliminate external dependencies for the generator to keep the core lightweight and standalone.\n      - Move LayoutIndexAttribute generation into the generator via PostInitializationOutput.\n      - Remove duplicate LayoutIndexAttribute from LuciferCore runtime code to avoid symbol conflicts and redundant codebase.\n\n      BREAKING CHANGE: LayoutIndexAttribute is now auto-generated by the\n      Roslyn Source Generator during compilation instead of being declared as a static class in runtime.",
